{"seq":3,"slug":"context-signals","title":"上下文信号处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/foundations/context-signals","wordCount":2644,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"上下文信号处理\">上下文信号处理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上下文感知推荐</td>\n<td>将场景、时间、地点等上下文融入推荐决策的方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间上下文</td>\n<td>时间段、星期、节假日等时间维度信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地点上下文</td>\n<td>用户当前或常驻的地理位置信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备上下文</td>\n<td>手机型号、屏幕尺寸、网络状态等设备信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话上下文</td>\n<td>当前浏览路径、停留时间、搜索词等即时行为信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文嵌入</td>\n<td>将上下文特征编码为向量，融入深度推荐模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[上下文信号] --&gt; B[时间维度]&#10;    A --&gt; C[地点维度]&#10;    A --&gt; D[设备维度]&#10;    A --&gt; E[会话维度]&#10;    B --&gt; F[时段/节假日/季节]&#10;    C --&gt; G[城市/商圈/场景]&#10;    D --&gt; H[设备型号/网络]&#10;    E --&gt; I[浏览路径/停留]&#10;    B --&gt; J[融入推荐模型]&#10;    C --&gt; J&#10;    D --&gt; J&#10;    E --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[上下文信号] --&gt; B[时间维度]\n    A --&gt; C[地点维度]\n    A --&gt; D[设备维度]\n    A --&gt; E[会话维度]\n    B --&gt; F[时段/节假日/季节]\n    C --&gt; G[城市/商圈/场景]\n    D --&gt; H[设备型号/网络]\n    E --&gt; I[浏览路径/停留]\n    B --&gt; J[融入推荐模型]\n    C --&gt; J\n    D --&gt; J\n    E --&gt; J</pre><p>传统的个性化推荐仅依赖用户历史行为，忽视了一个关键事实：<strong>相同的用户在不同场景下有截然不同的需求</strong>。早上通勤时想看快消品，晚上休闲时才会浏览奢侈品；下雨天推荐雨伞胜过推荐沙滩装。上下文信号处理正是将这些&quot;当下情景&quot;信息系统性地引入推荐决策，从而让推荐更贴近用户的即时需求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上下文感知推荐的理论框架\">上下文感知推荐的理论框架</h2><p>经典的推荐问题建模为用户-商品矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{m \\times n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，上下文感知推荐将其扩展为三维张量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{m \\times n \\times k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是上下文维度的数量。这个扩展带来了表达能力的提升，也带来了数据稀疏性的挑战（三维空间中的非零元素更加稀疏）。</p>\n<p>实践中更常用的处理方式是将上下文特征与用户特征、商品特征一起输入到统一的特征交叉模型（如 FM/DeepFM）或深度神经网络，而非维护显式的三维张量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间上下文\">时间上下文</h2><p>时间是最基础也最重要的上下文维度，影响用户需求的方式是多维度的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时间段效应\">时间段效应</h3><p>一天中的不同时段对应不同的购物场景和需求状态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时段</th>\n<th>购物行为特征</th>\n<th>推荐策略调整</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>7:00-9:00（通勤早高峰）</td>\n<td>碎片化浏览，决策时间短</td>\n<td>主推高频消耗品、预购次日达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12:00-14:00（午休）</td>\n<td>较完整的购物时间</td>\n<td>食品饮料、办公用品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>18:00-22:00（晚间黄金时段）</td>\n<td>沉浸式购物，决策时间长</td>\n<td>高客单价商品、品质生活类目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>22:00-24:00（深夜）</td>\n<td>冲动型购物</td>\n<td>零食、娱乐、个护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时段特征通常以 sin/cos 周期编码（而非直接使用小时数字），以保留时间的循环性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>hour_sin</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>hour_cos</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{hour\\_sin} = \\sin\\left(\\frac{2\\pi \\cdot h}{24}\\right), \\quad \\text{hour\\_cos} = \\cos\\left(\\frac{2\\pi \\cdot h}{24}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hour_sin</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hour_cos</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>同样的编码方式适用于星期（周期=7）和月份（周期=12）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"节假日与促销效应\">节假日与促销效应</h3><p>节假日（春节、618、双11）会导致用户需求的大幅偏移：品类偏好变化（送礼需求激增）、价格敏感度变化（大促期间用户对折扣的注意力大幅提升）、决策时间变化（大促期间会提前加购、集中付款）。</p>\n<p><strong>节假日特征设计</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>is_holiday</code>：布尔特征，是否是法定假日</li>\n<li><code>holiday_type</code>：类别特征（春节、国庆、母亲节等）</li>\n<li><code>days_to_event</code>：距下一个重大促销活动的天数</li>\n<li><code>event_phase</code>：活动阶段（预热期、爆发期、返场期）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"季节性与趋势\">季节性与趋势</h3><p>服装、食品、家居等品类有强烈的季节性。准确的季节特征建模能显著提升长尾用户的推荐质量——即使用户历史上没有购买过冬装，在冬季来临时向其推荐冬装也是合理的。</p>\n<p><strong>趋势感知</strong>：捕捉快时尚、网红爆品的快速兴起，需要引入商品层面的时序热度特征（近7天、30天曝光量的增速），在用户画像中补充&quot;时尚敏感度&quot;维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"地点上下文\">地点上下文</h2><p>地理位置提供了用户需求的重要上下文，尤其在 O2O（线上到线下）和本地生活场景中至关重要。</p>\n<h3 id=\"城市与区域特征\">城市与区域特征</h3><p>不同城市的消费水平、偏好风格、气候条件存在显著差异。一线城市用户对国际品牌的接受度更高，东北用户在冬季对保暖类商品的需求更强。</p>\n<p>城市特征通常通过<strong>查表编码</strong>实现：维护一个城市属性表（GDP、人口、气候带、消费水平指数等），查询用户所在城市的属性向量并拼接到用户特征中。</p>\n<h3 id=\"即时地点信号\">即时地点信号</h3><p>用户当前位置（如在购物中心、机场、写字楼）能推断出强烈的即时需求。开启了位置权限的 App 可以利用此信号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在商场附近 → 可能有线下比价需求 → 推荐同款线上商品的价格比较</li>\n<li>在机场 → 出行场景 → 推荐旅行用品、目的地相关商品</li>\n<li>在健身房附近 → 运动场景 → 推荐运动装备</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：地点权限属于高度敏感的用户隐私数据，需要严格遵循数据收集最小化原则，仅在用户明确授权后使用，且不得跨 App 或会话长期留存精确位置历史。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设备上下文\">设备上下文</h2><p>设备特征是个性化引擎中最容易获取、最常被忽视的上下文维度之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"设备型号与消费能力\">设备型号与消费能力</h3><p>手机型号（苹果旗舰、中端安卓、低端入门机）是消费能力的有效代理指标。使用 iPhone 14 Pro 的用户与使用数百元入门手机的用户，在价格区间偏好上通常有系统性差异。</p>\n<p>这是一种<strong>弱信号</strong>——消费能力偏好是统计规律，不是每个用户都符合。应将其作为初始先验，随着更多行为数据积累后逐渐降低其权重。</p>\n<h3 id=\"网络与加载性能\">网络与加载性能</h3><p><strong>网络状态</strong>（WiFi vs 4G/5G vs 弱网）影响内容加载能力，进而影响推荐策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>弱网环境：减少高清大图商品展示，优先推荐小图快加载的商品</li>\n<li>WiFi 环境：可以展示视频主图商品，提升视觉冲击力</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>屏幕尺寸</strong>：平板用户与手机用户的浏览行为和转化率有差异，平板上的可视商品数更多，适合&quot;发现型&quot;推荐；手机上的单商品展示面积更大，适合&quot;精准型&quot;推荐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"会话上下文\">会话上下文</h2><p>会话上下文（Session Context）是最强的即时信号，直接反映用户在<strong>这次打开 App</strong>中的购物意图。</p>\n<h3 id=\"会话内行为序列\">会话内行为序列</h3><p>用户在当前会话内的浏览路径、搜索词、点击商品构成了最直接的意图信号。如果用户在本次会话中已经浏览了10个篮球，推荐第11个篮球相关商品的转化率远高于推荐其他品类。</p>\n<p><strong>会话感知召回</strong>：基于当前会话的行为提取实时意图向量，通过向量检索找到与当前意图最相关的候选商品，作为召回层的补充（见第3章）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"搜索词与浏览路径\">搜索词与浏览路径</h3><p>用户的搜索词是最明确的意图表达。在搜索结果页的推荐（如&quot;猜你喜欢&quot;）应重度参考搜索词上下文：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"用户搜索：&quot;连衣裙 小个子&quot;&#10;→ 搜索词意图：连衣裙品类 + 小个子体型适配需求&#10;→ 个性化权重调整：提升显瘦款、小个子款的排序分数\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>用户搜索：\"连衣裙 小个子\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>→ 搜索词意图：连衣裙品类 + 小个子体型适配需求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>→ 个性化权重调整：提升显瘦款、小个子款的排序分数</span></span></code></pre></div><p>浏览路径信号（从哪个页面跳转过来）提供了推荐场景的隐式上下文：从&quot;品牌专区&quot;进入的用户可能有品牌忠诚度，从&quot;今日爆款&quot;进入的用户可能更追求性价比。</p>\n<h3 id=\"购物车与愿望单信号\">购物车与愿望单信号</h3><p>购物车中的商品是用户最强的显式意图表达——已经决策到加购的用户只差支付一步。对已加购商品的关联商品（搭配品、配件、同款其他颜色）进行推荐，转化率极高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上下文特征的融入方式\">上下文特征的融入方式</h2><h3 id=\"特征拼接\">特征拼接</h3><p>最简单的方式：将上下文特征向量直接拼接到用户特征和商品特征，一起输入深度推荐模型。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{e}_{input} = [\\mathbf{e}_{user} \\| \\mathbf{e}_{item} \\| \\mathbf{e}_{context}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7305em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>优点</strong>：实现简单，通用性强。<strong>缺点</strong>：不同上下文之间、以及上下文与用户/商品特征之间的交叉关系需要模型自行学习，对模型容量要求较高。</p>\n<h3 id=\"上下文门控机制\">上下文门控机制</h3><p>使用上下文信号动态调整用户兴趣的权重，而非简单地拼接：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{g} = \\sigma(\\mathbf{W}_c \\cdot \\mathbf{e}_{context})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">h</mi><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">g</mi><mo>⊙</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">h</mi><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊙</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">h</mi><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{h}_u^{ctx} = \\mathbf{g} \\odot \\mathbf{h}_u^{long} + (1 - \\mathbf{g}) \\odot \\mathbf{h}_u^{short}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0906em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊙</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊙</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这种方式让模型能学习到&quot;节假日场景下更多参考长期兴趣（礼品购买），通勤场景下更多参考当前 session 意图&quot;的规律。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多塔架构中的上下文塔\">多塔架构中的上下文塔</h3><p>在双塔或多塔召回模型中，设置独立的上下文塔（Context Tower）对时间、地点、会话信号进行编码，输出与用户塔和商品塔等维度的上下文向量，三者融合后进行相似度计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(u, i, c) = f_{user}(u)^T \\cdot f_{item}(i) + f_{user}(u)^T \\cdot f_{ctx}(c) + f_{item}(i)^T \\cdot f_{ctx}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vl